    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100373" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεργ-ᾰσία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>company</i> or <i>guild
				of fellow-workmen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ς. τῶν ἀργυροκόπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1263
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>JHS</u>
				54.75
			</span></i> (ibid.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				704
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>H</u>
				26
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				495.6
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cibyra</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ
				τῶν γναφέων ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.643
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Acmonia</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a place where many slaves are lodged, a workers' barracks</i>,
			Lat. <i>ergastulum</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ς. ἐμβαλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					20.13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				34
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				5.2.36
			</span></i>.</div>
